WEBVTT

01:41.331 --> 01:45.791
'Haruki-ya"

01:58.681 --> 02:02.674
Groups of unemployed workers, who have
grown in number due fo the tax reforms

02:02.852 --> 02:06.015
enacted by the former prime minister,
are rioting all across the country.

02:06.189 --> 02:09.602
And with the confusion among members
of parliament sparked by the comments of

02:09.692 --> 02:13.105
finance minister takanashi
during a recent parliament inquiry,

02:13.196 --> 02:17.610
there seems flo be no compromise in sight
between the government and opposition.

02:17.742 --> 02:19.528
Hey. What'll it be?

02:19.619 --> 02:21.701
Give me three peanuts.

02:23.039 --> 02:24.779
Let's see here...

02:39.597 --> 02:42.134
We've herded those
clown bastards onto route 5.

02:45.228 --> 02:47.810
Damn it, don't scare me like that!
Open the damn door quietly!

02:47.939 --> 02:51.397
You wouldn't be so jumpy if
you didn't have something to hide!

02:53.820 --> 02:55.547
Try selling some normal
drinks sometime, huh?

02:55.571 --> 02:59.564
How about buying something
for once?! This ain't a hangout!

02:59.659 --> 03:01.820
And drink that dog piss you sell?!

03:05.456 --> 03:09.916
Twin ceramic rotor drives on each wheel...

03:10.086 --> 03:15.331
And these are... computer
controlled anti-lock brakes...

03:15.425 --> 03:18.588
200 horsepower at 12,000 rpm...

03:20.847 --> 03:23.338
You wanna ride it, tetsuo?

03:23.474 --> 03:25.760
All right, let's go!

03:27.729 --> 03:31.597
That bike's been customized just for me.
It's too wild. You couldn't handle it.

03:32.483 --> 03:35.020
I don't see how you can
ride something like that, man.

03:36.988 --> 03:38.273
I could!

03:38.948 --> 03:41.940
If you want one so bad,
steal a big one for yourself.

04:47.892 --> 04:48.892
Unbelievable.

04:49.018 --> 04:51.930
School kids these days...

04:52.313 --> 04:54.019
Wait! Hey, waiter!

04:57.860 --> 05:00.602
They ran into the alley! After 'em!

05:13.960 --> 05:16.793
This isn't a game, you idiot!

05:19.882 --> 05:21.713
Shit...!

06:25.239 --> 06:26.239
That's...

06:27.325 --> 06:28.940
This is car 375.

06:29.076 --> 06:34.116
We ve got reports of biker gangs fighting
near the intersection of highway 14 south!

06:34.206 --> 06:37.949
Request immediate assistance!
Car 375, en route fo the scene!

06:39.086 --> 06:40.542
It's the cops! What should we do?

06:40.630 --> 06:43.622
Damn, and my motor coils
were just getting warmed up...

06:48.888 --> 06:50.469
Bastards...

06:50.598 --> 06:52.554
Let's go, tetsuo!

06:52.683 --> 06:53.798
Right!

06:53.893 --> 06:55.303
Damn!

07:04.946 --> 07:07.983
A skirmish has broken out
between student protesters

07:08.157 --> 07:11.037
and riot police assigned as security.
There appear to be some casualties.

07:11.160 --> 07:12.240
Furthermore...

07:29.178 --> 07:30.338
What the...?

07:33.182 --> 07:34.672
What the hell's going on?!

07:34.850 --> 07:37.262
Move it, jerk! I'm in a hurry!

07:52.785 --> 07:54.195
What was that?!

07:54.370 --> 07:55.701
Call the police!

08:02.211 --> 08:05.294
Repeal the tax reforms!

08:21.939 --> 08:28.060
This area is off-limits!
Go back! It's dangerous!

08:28.195 --> 08:29.310
Something's strange here...

08:29.405 --> 08:31.145
Let me through! I'm sorry, let me through!

08:31.282 --> 08:32.818
What's the big idea?

08:40.374 --> 08:42.160
Look! Blood!

08:43.002 --> 08:43.866
Who are they?

08:43.961 --> 08:45.497
- Excuse me.
- Hey! Don't push!

08:45.588 --> 08:46.327
Excuse me.

08:46.422 --> 08:48.253
Hey! Watch it, jerk!

08:51.719 --> 08:54.256
Pardon me. I'm sorry.

08:54.388 --> 08:55.673
Ryu!

08:55.806 --> 08:57.421
Hey! He ran away!

09:03.272 --> 09:04.512
He's got a gun!

09:10.279 --> 09:11.610
Fire!

09:14.116 --> 09:16.323
Hold your fire! There's a kid with him!

09:26.337 --> 09:27.543
Run...

09:29.006 --> 09:30.792
Hurry...

09:35.054 --> 09:36.760
Go to ryu...

09:36.972 --> 09:39.714
Ryu will help you now...

09:43.562 --> 09:46.895
Hurry... get out of here...

10:18.639 --> 10:19.639
Kei!

10:22.017 --> 10:24.099
What are you doing? Hurry!

10:28.232 --> 10:30.018
He vanished...!

10:38.784 --> 10:41.116
He's to the west.

10:41.203 --> 10:44.366
The west? He's in the old city, then.

10:55.217 --> 10:56.457
Eat this!

11:08.898 --> 11:10.559
Tetsuo!

11:26.373 --> 11:29.661
'Closed: Beyond this point is
unrepaired, unrestored old city area.”

11:39.595 --> 11:42.007
'Oppose imperialism”

11:49.730 --> 11:52.392
Ryu! Ryu, where are you?

11:56.111 --> 11:57.111
Kei!

12:23.889 --> 12:24.969
No, that's...!

12:46.453 --> 12:47.818
How you like that?!

12:57.172 --> 12:59.458
Well? Who is it?

12:59.842 --> 13:02.003
It's not him! It's not tetsuo!

13:02.553 --> 13:04.009
Okay! Let's go!

13:09.018 --> 13:14.354
You little... what did you do...?

13:27.286 --> 13:30.028
Tetsuo! Hang on! Hey!

13:32.333 --> 13:33.789
Huh? What did you say?

13:33.876 --> 13:35.457
That kid...

13:38.547 --> 13:40.583
He's hurt bad!

13:41.383 --> 13:44.716
Hey! Wait!

13:44.803 --> 13:45.864
We gotta get him to a hospital!

13:45.888 --> 13:49.380
- He needs an ambulance!
- We can't move him!

13:58.984 --> 14:00.724
W-what the hell?!

14:15.250 --> 14:16.615
There's no escape.

14:23.675 --> 14:25.256
We ve come for you.

14:31.225 --> 14:36.845
We can't survive on the outside.
Come on, let's go home.

14:39.566 --> 14:41.773
It's the army! Those are army helicopters!

14:48.951 --> 14:50.191
Move out!

15:01.296 --> 15:03.287
Down on your stomachs!
Spread your arms and legs!

15:03.298 --> 15:06.236
