samsara Asa sssomseasamsnasees
the time of his awakening I

44:57.549 --> 44:57.628
'lord Akira the enlightened”

44:57.633 --> 45:00.670
samsara Asa sssomseasamsnasees
the time of his awakening I

45:00.677 --> 45:00.756
'lord Akira the enlightened”

45:00.761 --> 45:03.093
samsara Asa sssomseasamsnasees
the time of his awakening I

45:03.096 --> 45:03.209
'lord Akira the enlightened”

45:03.222 --> 45:05.503
samsara Asa sssomseasamsnasees
the time of his awakening I

45:06.099 --> 45:08.385
terrorist activities carried out by

45:08.477 --> 45:12.061
anti-government elements
have skyrocketed this month.

45:12.147 --> 45:16.265
The army, riot police, and even
traffic police have been fully mobilized.

45:16.360 --> 45:19.727
The overtime costs alone have
used up the public safety budget.

45:19.821 --> 45:22.153
And then there's the
abduction of number 26!

45:22.282 --> 45:25.445
Isn't their existence supposed
to be highest of state secrets?

45:25.577 --> 45:28.740
No one's ever heard of "peace
and order" here in Neo Tokyo, then?

45:28.956 --> 45:32.540
And then there's this request of yours

45:32.626 --> 45:37.586
for further funding because
of subject number 25s prediction.

45:37.673 --> 45:39.209
You must be joking!

45:39.299 --> 45:44.464
We parliament members have been
begging the public to bear with us

45:44.554 --> 45:49.765
while we straighten out the former prime
minister's historic tax reform blunders,

45:49.851 --> 45:52.888
so where, exactly, are we
supposed to get that kind of money?!

45:52.980 --> 45:57.599
You've spent a fortune, and all we have to
show for it is that grotesque kindergarten!

45:57.693 --> 46:00.230
The Olympics are next year.
The postwar period is over.

46:00.320 --> 46:03.733
How much longer will you keep
spending money on some ghost?!

46:03.865 --> 46:06.982
I always said that we should've put
that money into the welfare program!

46:07.077 --> 46:08.157
Shut up, old man!

46:08.245 --> 46:09.245
What?!

46:09.288 --> 46:13.122
That power is starting to
walk around free as we speak.

46:13.208 --> 46:18.578
- Unless we control it now, we'll lose everything!
- Who do you think you're talking to, youngster?

46:18.714 --> 46:21.672
It was your lack of policy that
started this mess in the first place!

46:21.967 --> 46:26.210
There's still no proof that the
last world war was caused by Akira!

46:26.388 --> 46:30.427
Won't you even try to
understand anything at all

46:30.517 --> 46:32.348
unless an Akira disaster actually happens?!

46:32.519 --> 46:35.056
Has anyone actually seen this "Akira"?

46:35.188 --> 46:37.520
Wasn't Akira number 25?

46:37.733 --> 46:39.769
No, I think he was number 21...

46:39.860 --> 46:43.478
The colonel has lost
sight of his duty as a soldier.

46:43.655 --> 46:45.987
I've had reports that
anti-government elements are using

46:46.074 --> 46:51.819
this "Akira" madness of yours as an
excuse to whip up their terrorist fervor!

46:51.913 --> 46:53.653
No! That's untrue!

46:53.999 --> 46:56.536
Then what about that
Akira world renewal movement?

46:56.626 --> 46:58.506
Wouldnt you say that
information's being leaked?

46:58.754 --> 47:01.917
World renewal movement?
End of the world, more like!

47:02.215 --> 47:05.878
Aren't you just using Akira as
camouflage to cover up your misconduct?

47:06.053 --> 47:07.714
What are you getting at?

47:07.929 --> 47:15.929
Colonel, we can no longer leave the
peace of Neo Tokyo to your sole discretion.

47:16.605 --> 47:17.605
Right!

47:17.689 --> 47:21.102
You are to be put before
an inquiry committee.

47:21.234 --> 47:22.234
I agree!

47:26.073 --> 47:27.404
Excuse me!

47:27.866 --> 47:29.902
Colonel! Colonel, where are you...

47:29.993 --> 47:32.484
Wait! This discussion isn't over yet!

47:32.621 --> 47:33.827
Explain yourself!

47:33.914 --> 47:37.077
Are you trying to insult the
supreme executive council?!

47:37.209 --> 47:37.994
Colonel...!

47:38.126 --> 47:39.662
Wait, colonel!

48:01.942 --> 48:03.352
W-water...

48:36.351 --> 48:38.387
Hey, wait a minute...

48:38.520 --> 48:42.183
Isn't that cable replacement
scheduled for next week?

48:42.357 --> 48:45.975
The cable they ordered came in early.

48:46.111 --> 48:48.272
Besides, I'm going on vacation
al the end of the week.

48:48.280 --> 48:50.236
“Verify pass cards” besides, I'm going
on vacation al the end of the week,

48:50.240 --> 48:50.319
“verify pass cards”

48:50.323 --> 48:52.689
“verify pass cards”
I've brought some workers with me, too.

48:52.701 --> 48:53.315
I've brought some workers with me, too.

48:53.618 --> 48:58.112
I could take it back, but the
work's gonna be done sooner or later.

49:03.170 --> 49:05.001
Okay, let's go.

50:35.345 --> 50:36.425
What the...?

51:06.042 --> 51:07.202
Milk?

51:15.594 --> 51:16.674
Stay away!

51:30.275 --> 51:30.980
Blood!

51:31.109 --> 51:32.315
I'm scared!

51:41.161 --> 51:42.367
Jerk!

51:42.579 --> 51:45.241
W-who the hell are they?

52:40.887 --> 52:44.379
Room 887, tetsuo shima...

52:44.724 --> 52:46.760
A problem with the automatic lock?

52:51.898 --> 52:54.935
Hey! You can't just walk
off from your room!

52:59.864 --> 53:01.400
Come on, let's go back.

53:01.491 --> 53:04.483
What the hell happened? What a mess!

53:27.434 --> 53:31.427
There are 58 blocks with circuits
that the computer won't display.

53:31.563 --> 53:35.932
Of those, nearly 40 are concentrated
on underground levels 7 and 8.

53:36.025 --> 53:37.265
That's probably the place.

53:39.487 --> 53:42.024
The central wiring shaft
should be up ahead.

53:42.157 --> 53:44.694
We should be able to use it
to go straight to the sublevels.

53:46.202 --> 53:49.365
Be careful. It's deeper in the middle.

53:49.497 --> 53:50.782
What a stink!

53:51.124 --> 53:51.863
Quiet!

53:51.958 --> 53:55.041
What? I said it stinks because it stinks!

53:55.170 --> 53:57.786
- Is your nose busted?
- Hurry up and stay quiet!

53:59.507 --> 54:01.964
Damn! Hide!

54:02.093 --> 54:03.378
Huh? Where?

54:03.511 --> 54:05.547
What're you doing, you idiot?!

54:19.486 --> 54:21.067
They left?

54:21.154 --> 54:22.735
Looks like they've beefed up security.

54:22.822 --> 54:24.483
Must be that siren we heard.

54:24.616 --> 54:26.051
What should we do? Scout around some?

54:26.075 --> 54:27.110
No.

54:27.577 --> 54:28.804
- Are you okay?
- Let's keep going.

54:28.828 --> 54:31.160
I want to check out their
security at the very least.

54:31.331 --> 54:32.331
All right.

54:32.499 --> 54:35.241
We've been spotted! Run!

54:35.376 --> 54:36.491
Shit!

54:36.669 --> 54:39.331
Don't! Don't shoot!

54:42.217 --> 54:46.005
Shimazaki! Shit!

54:46.095 --> 54:47.835
Forget about him! Run!

54:51.684 --> 54:53.299
What the hell is that?

54:54.729 --> 54:55.935
Here it comes!

54:56.898 --> 54:58.934
Forget it! You can't do any good!

55:03.988 --> 55:05.569
Die!

55:06.658 --> 55:08.319
This is unit 304, shaft h!

55:08.409 --> 55:12.118
I have encountered intruders
and am engaging! Request backup!

55:12.789 --> 55:13.949
Here it comes!

55:40.191 --> 55:41.271
Kei!

55:44.112 --> 55:45.397
Where's that gun?!

55:45.947 --> 55:47.903
Damnit...!

55:50.243 --> 55:51.574
Kaneda!

56:01.713 --> 56:03.328
Kei, this way!

56:04.424 --> 56:06.415
Hurry!

56:07.635 --> 56:09.921
Kaneda, hurry!

56:25.111 --> 56:26.772
Kaneda!

56:39.626 --> 56:41.787
The brakes! Where are the brakes?!

56:41.878 --> 56:43.084
That's not it?

56:43.171 --> 56:45.002
This is the central wiring shaft!

56:45.131 --> 56:46.792
It's gotta be this one, then!

56:52.931 --> 56:55.798
Okay, I'm getting the hang of this!

56:55.934 --> 56:58.050
Ask the colonel for clearance fo fire!

56:58.227 --> 56:59.763
Turn that up!

57:00.313 --> 57:01.769
There must be some mistake.

57:01.856 --> 57:04.393
That boy looks like the
patient they admitted to the /ab.

57:04.484 --> 57:07.817
The boy, the subject named
telsuo shima, broke out of his room.

57:07.904 --> 57:09.986
I think he's headed for the baby room.

57:10.073 --> 57:11.279
Tetsuo?!

57:11.366 --> 57:13.982
He is in an extremely dangerous
state! Don't let him through!

57:14.118 --> 57:16.780
I repeal, do not let him through!

57:44.857 --> 57:45.937
What the...?

57:53.741 --> 57:55.356
It's no use hiding.

57:55.535 --> 57:57.696
We have no choice, then. Use your guns!

57:57.787 --> 58:00.950
We can't let him go any
farther, no matter what it takes!

58:02.000 --> 58:03.456
Fire!

58:42.957 --> 58:45.494
So, here you are...

58:50.757 --> 58:51.872
Stop it!

58:54.427 --> 58:57.169
How long are you
gonna keep playing around?!

59:03.978 --> 59:06.014
Where'd the other one go?

59:07.440 --> 59:08.850
Why, you...

59:10.234 --> 59:11.599
Die!

59:14.113 --> 59:15.603
Takashi!

59:25.708 --> 59:30.748
What the hell is going on?
Am I dreaming or something?

59:31.130 --> 59:34.543
I never knew I had powers like this!

59:41.641 --> 59:43.802
Damn it, which way should I go?!

59:44.143 --> 59:47.306
Straight. Straight ahead...

59:47.814 --> 59:48.814
Huh?

59:48.856 --> 59:50.812
There's a freight elevator.

59:52.944 --> 59:55.811
We can take it to sublevel 8.

01:00:04.080 --> 01:00:06.662
Good, you're all together.

01:00:08.251 --> 01:00:10.993
You thought you could kill me?

01:00:11.921 --> 01:00:16.335
You tried to mess with me...
I'm gonna kill you!

01:00:21.764 --> 01:00:23.880
That was you...

01:00:24.183 --> 01:00:25.514
Takashi!

01:00:25.685 --> 01:00:27.596
Attack him together!

01:00:27.687 --> 01:00:29.678
0-okay.

01:00:34.110 --> 01:00:35.850
You little twerps!

01:00:52.420 --> 01:00:54.206
That's enough! All of you!

01:01:02.513 --> 01:01:04.378
Who the hell are you?!

01:01:07.977 --> 01:01:11.219
What's the matter?
Does your head hurt, tetsuo shima?

01:01:11.355 --> 01:01:13.220
Your power isn't fully matured.

01:01:13.357 --> 01:01:15.564
If you push yourself,
you might do irreparable damage.

01:01:15.693 --> 01:01:17.729
Just do as we tell you.

01:01:17.862 --> 01:01:22.606
What the hell did you
people do to my head?!

01:01:31.083 --> 01:01:33.165
Calm yourself, tetsuo shima!

01:01:33.294 --> 01:01:35.125
He can't control it.

01:01:40.426 --> 01:01:41.461
What?!

01:01:41.594 --> 01:01:47.134
She said that big people like you
should never use the power like that.

01:01:47.266 --> 01:01:49.257
She says something horrible will happen.

01:01:49.894 --> 01:01:51.555
Mind your own business.

01:01:54.357 --> 01:01:57.565
What? More powerful than me?

01:02:00.112 --> 01:02:05.197
He's the one! He's been popping
in and out of my head lately!

01:02:05.284 --> 01:02:08.026
Where is he?! Where's this "Akira"?!

01:02:08.162 --> 01:02:08.821
What?!

01:02:08.955 --> 01:02:13.039
Kiyoko said that you'll awaken Akira.

01:02:13.125 --> 01:02:15.958
If that happens, no one
will be able to stop him.

01:02:16.128 --> 01:02:17.856
So before that can happen,
we have to stop you.

01:02:17.880 --> 01:02:19.711
Impossible! Akira's already...

01:02:19.840 --> 01:02:22.798
Where is he?!

01:02:24.011 --> 01:02:25.126
Stop it!

01:02:25.304 --> 01:02:26.794
Shut up!

01:02:32.353 --> 01:02:36.062
Threat level to facility
integrity has passed level 7.

01:02:36.190 --> 01:02:40.308
Enacting disaster protocols.

01:02:40.486 --> 01:02:43.819
Threat level to facility
integrity has passed level 7.

01:02:43.990 --> 01:02:47.153
Enacting disaster protocols.

01:02:47.285 --> 01:02:48.570
What the...?!

01:02:56.002 --> 01:02:57.492
Hands up!

01:03:00.464 --> 01:03:02.500
Where the hell is the "baby room"?!

01:03:14.895 --> 01:03:16.431
Oh, no! Run!

01:03:21.569 --> 01:03:23.776
Gangway, coming through! Coming through!

01:03:23.863 --> 01:03:25.353
Damn it, move!

01:03:27.616 --> 01:03:28.856
Kiyoko...

01:03:48.721 --> 01:03:50.461
Damn, that hurt...

01:03:50.598 --> 01:03:54.011
Kaneda? What're you doing here?

01:03:57.021 --> 01:04:00.388
Tetsuo! Are you okay?
I'm here to rescue you!

01:04:02.401 --> 01:04:06.735
Hurry up, you moron! If we don't get out
of here, those guys outside are gonna...

01:04:08.240 --> 01:04:10.731
There he is! Catch him!

01:04:12.912 --> 01:04:15.153
Stay away from me!

01:04:19.085 --> 01:04:20.416
Kaneda!

01:04:22.838 --> 01:04:26.080
Oh, right. I forgot you were there, kaneda.

01:04:27.385 --> 01:04:29.376
That's okay, kaneda.

01:04:29.595 --> 01:04:33.213
I won't be needing you to save me anymore.

01:04:34.266 --> 01:04:36.973
From now on, I'll be saving you.

01:04:37.103 --> 01:04:40.186
All you have to do is ask, kanny.

01:04:40.272 --> 01:04:45.187
Say what? Who the hell do
you think you're talking to?!

01:04:46.153 --> 01:04:48.940
You don't like the way I talk?

01:04:49.031 --> 01:04:50.612
Does it make you mad?

01:04:50.699 --> 01:04:52.189
Well, what're you gonna do about it?!

01:04:52.284 --> 01:04:56.277
Huh, kaneda?! What're
you gonna do about it?!

01:05:05.464 --> 01:05:10.629
That's enough! Don't hurt anyone else!

01:05:12.304 --> 01:05:14.920
Where's this "Akira" guy?!

01:05:15.015 --> 01:05:16.551
He..

01:05:17.268 --> 01:05:20.431
The olympic stadium...?
In an underground facility?

01:05:20.563 --> 01:05:23.896
No! You're wrong! Akira is...

01:05:25.818 --> 01:05:27.399
Wait!

01:05:36.871 --> 01:05:41.331
What the hell? I can do this, too?!

01:05:47.465 --> 01:05:49.501
Kiyoko, are you okay?

01:05:49.633 --> 01:05:51.464
It doesn't look like she's hurt.

01:05:51.552 --> 01:05:54.134
What about you, Masaru? You're bleeding.

01:05:54.346 --> 01:05:56.257
What happened to him?

01:05:56.348 --> 01:05:57.633
He flew away.

01:05:57.725 --> 01:06:00.182
How can he have so much power...?

01:06:02.521 --> 01:06:06.355
How could this have
happened? Is anyone here?

01:06:06.442 --> 01:06:09.934
He's developed so much
power in such a short time...

01:06:10.362 --> 01:06:12.398
Find him! Find tetsuo!

01:06:12.698 --> 01:06:15.735
- Find him! Go after him!
- Kaneda! Hang on, kaneda!

01:06:15.868 --> 01:06:18.701
Hurry up! Get that rubble cleared!

01:06:20.956 --> 01:06:22.696
He went to where Akira is.

01:06:22.791 --> 01:06:26.500
What? You're all safe!

01:06:26.795 --> 01:06:30.708
He's heading for the facility
below the olympic construction site.

01:06:30.841 --> 01:06:32.672
How did tetsuo find out about that?!

01:06:36.347 --> 01:06:39.885
You mean he's gone outside?

01:06:42.394 --> 01:06:45.886
Damn it! We'll follow him!
Prepare for pursuit!

01:06:46.023 --> 01:06:47.513
- Yes, sir!
- He's heading west!

01:06:47.608 --> 01:06:50.224
He's heading for the
olympic construction site!

01:06:50.361 --> 01:06:52.943
Tell them to beef up their security!

01:06:53.072 --> 01:06:55.028
- You...!
- Set up checkpoints on all...

01:07:01.163 --> 01:07:05.623
According to the defense team, intruders
were encountered in the wiring shaft.

01:07:05.751 --> 01:07:07.412
Two disguised as workers resisted
and were shot, and the rest are at large.

01:07:07.419 --> 01:07:12.339
Two disguised as workers resisted and were shot, and the rest
are at large. He has to be stopped before his powers mature...

01:07:12.967 --> 01:07:15.754
Your objective is the boy tetsuo shima.

01:07:15.844 --> 01:07:19.132
If we are unable to capture him, you will
lure him out to the old city and attack.

01:07:19.265 --> 01:07:21.426
Request assistance from
the eastern district battalion.

01:07:21.559 --> 01:07:22.173
Yes, sir!

01:07:22.268 --> 01:07:24.429
Tell them there isn't 2A moment to lose!

01:07:26.689 --> 01:07:28.805
I've been waiting for you, colonel.

01:07:30.067 --> 01:07:31.603
Who the hell are you?!

01:07:33.445 --> 01:07:37.438
I'm here to inform you of the
supreme executive council's decision.

01:07:39.410 --> 01:07:43.699
At 2400 hours today, the colonel is
hereby stripped of his command and rank,

01:07:43.789 --> 01:07:46.155
and will be placed under arrest.

01:07:46.292 --> 01:07:47.372
What?!

01:07:48.294 --> 01:07:50.626
Please come with us.

01:07:50.838 --> 01:07:55.047
You expect me to hand Neo Tokyo
over to those fools at a time like this?

01:07:57.970 --> 01:07:59.301
- Shoot him.
- Yes, sir!

01:07:59.388 --> 01:08:00.969
What?

01:08:01.098 --> 01:08:02.884
W-wait!

01:08:04.351 --> 01:08:08.139
Enough! Open your eyes
and look at the big picture!

01:08:08.314 --> 01:08:11.397
We can't dance to the tune of
corrupt politicians and capitalists!

01:08:15.654 --> 01:08:19.146
Don't you understand?!
It's pointless to fight anymore!

01:08:23.454 --> 01:08:27.788
Announce a state of emergency,
arrest all members of the executive council

01:08:27.875 --> 01:08:30.366
and remove them from
the chain of command!

01:08:30.669 --> 01:08:32.330
We're going after tetsuo!

01:08:32.504 --> 01:08:36.338
Urgent message to all
district battalion commanders'

01:08:41.722 --> 01:08:44.930
'Haruki-ya"

01:08:46.268 --> 01:08:50.011
hey, what's up? You by yourself?

01:08:52.191 --> 01:08:54.648
Weren't you in an accident or something?

01:08:54.735 --> 01:08:57.898
Everybody's been worried.
So, you feeling better?

01:08:58.364 --> 01:09:00.650
Gimme some... capsules.

01:09:02.034 --> 01:09:05.697
Hey, are you sure about that?
You don't look so hot.

01:09:05.871 --> 01:09:07.782
Just hand em over!

01:09:08.999 --> 01:09:11.035
All right, if you say so.

01:09:11.168 --> 01:09:15.457
But with all those demonstrations and
terrorist attacks lately, things are rough.

01:09:15.631 --> 01:09:19.544
They're hard to come by,
so they're pretty expensive.

01:09:25.724 --> 01:09:30.559
Tetsuo's run off, kaneda's disappeared...
I guess the team's finished.

01:09:30.688 --> 01:09:35.899
And the checkpoints are so strict,
even the clowns are staying put.

01:09:45.369 --> 01:09:46.575
Whats wrong?

01:09:47.413 --> 01:09:48.493
“This end up”

01:09:50.165 --> 01:09:51.245
he's dead!

01:09:51.375 --> 01:09:52.581
What?!

01:09:54.920 --> 01:09:56.251
What the...?

01:10:01.927 --> 01:10:02.962
Tetsuo?

01:10:03.095 --> 01:10:07.759
What are you doing here?

01:10:07.850 --> 01:10:10.557
You want some, too?

01:10:10.686 --> 01:10:14.304
What are you talking about, damn it?!
What the hell happened here?!

01:10:14.440 --> 01:10:16.647
The barkeep's dead!

01:10:19.945 --> 01:10:22.937
A fish out of water dies, huh?

01:10:23.031 --> 01:10:28.151
You are tetsuo... aren't you?

01:10:29.163 --> 01:10:31.154
Kaneda sends his regards.

01:10:31.331 --> 01:10:32.912
You saw kaneda?!

01:10:33.000 --> 01:10:35.207
He's probably dead by now...

01:10:38.630 --> 01:10:42.168
You did this, tetsuo?

01:10:42.301 --> 01:10:46.670
So anyway... where's kaneda's bike?

01:10:46.805 --> 01:10:47.805
Tetsuo!

01:10:49.057 --> 01:10:51.139
I don't need a piece of
junk like that anymore...

01:10:51.310 --> 01:10:52.641
You son of a...

01:10:58.400 --> 01:10:59.731
Yamagata!

01:11:06.492 --> 01:11:08.153
Shit...

01:11:15.209 --> 01:11:17.040
He went to where Akira is?

01:11:17.169 --> 01:11:19.330
That's what that girl said.

01:11:19.505 --> 01:11:23.839
The army, you, and ryu are
all looking for this "Akira" guy,

01:11:23.967 --> 01:11:26.128
so that's why you're chasing after tetsuo.

01:11:26.220 --> 01:11:30.179
It has something to do with
that power of tetsuo's, right?

01:11:30.349 --> 01:11:32.761
What the hell is this "Akira"
thing you keep talking about?

01:11:35.521 --> 01:11:40.515
Ryu told me about it once.
He said that Akira is absolute energy.

01:11:40.651 --> 01:11:42.516
Absolute energy?

01:11:42.653 --> 01:11:46.566
Humans do all kinds of
things during their lifetime, right?

01:11:46.698 --> 01:11:50.691
Discovering things, building things...

01:11:51.620 --> 01:11:58.367
Things like houses, motorcycles,
Bridges, cities, and rockets...

01:11:59.169 --> 01:12:02.627
All that knowledge and energy...
Where do you suppose it comes from?

01:12:04.424 --> 01:12:07.882
Humans were like monkeys once, right?

01:12:08.053 --> 01:12:11.591
And before that, like reptiles and fish.

01:12:11.723 --> 01:12:15.716
And before that, plankton and amoebas.

01:12:15.853 --> 01:12:20.142
Even creatures like those have
incredible energy inside them.

01:12:20.232 --> 01:12:23.440
Because of genes, I guess.

01:12:28.866 --> 01:12:31.323
Even in space dust, too, I bet.

01:12:31.410 --> 01:12:35.653
If that's true, what
memories are hidden in it?

01:12:35.831 --> 01:12:39.574
The beginning of the universe, maybe.
Or maybe even before that.

01:12:39.668 --> 01:12:43.752
Hey, what's the matter? Are you okay?

01:12:43.881 --> 01:12:46.088
Did you get hit on the head back there?

01:12:46.258 --> 01:12:49.750
Maybe everyone has those memories.

01:12:50.095 --> 01:12:53.212
What if there were some mistake
and the progression went wrong,

01:12:53.307 --> 01:12:57.676
and something like an amoeba
were given power like a human's?

01:12:59.271 --> 01:13:01.011
That's what Akira is?

01:13:01.940 --> 01:13:05.103
Amoebas don't build houses and Bridges.

01:13:05.277 --> 01:13:07.984
They just devour all the food around them.

01:13:08.113 --> 01:13:12.527
That's what tetsuo's doing?
You're saying he has that kind of energy?!

01:13:12.743 --> 01:13:17.487
A long time ago, there were people
who tried to control that power.

01:13:17.623 --> 01:13:19.864
At the government's request, you see.

01:13:19.958 --> 01:13:24.543
They failed, and it triggered
the fall of Tokyo.

01:13:25.464 --> 01:13:29.548
That power is still too much for...

01:13:31.595 --> 01:13:32.595
What?!

01:13:33.430 --> 01:13:34.886
The door's unlocked.

01:13:38.477 --> 01:13:39.637
Huh?

01:13:44.733 --> 01:13:47.645
This has got to be a trap.

01:13:47.819 --> 01:13:48.854
Go back, then.

01:13:48.987 --> 01:13:52.696
No, we ought to find out
how much of it is a trap...

01:13:54.910 --> 01:13:59.995
By the way, what's
with you and that ryu guy?

01:14:00.123 --> 01:14:02.205
- What do you mean?
- You're always together.

01:14:02.334 --> 01:14:04.450
That's none of your business!

01:14:05.045 --> 01:14:09.288
What I'm saying is, he doesn't
know about us, does he?

01:14:10.008 --> 01:14:10.838
"Us"?

01:14:10.968 --> 01:14:14.210
Hey, wait a minute!
What's that supposed to mean?

01:14:14.346 --> 01:14:15.756
Do you think this will work?

01:14:15.889 --> 01:14:22.226
It can't be helped. At this point,
our only aption is fo use her.

01:14:22.354 --> 01:14:29.192
The fact that she turned up right
under our noses says as mich, I think.

01:14:29.319 --> 01:14:30.434
I guess...

01:14:44.376 --> 01:14:48.619
Have arrived at ward 13,
east ginza intersection. Over.

01:14:48.714 --> 01:14:52.047
Northern district battalion has not
responded to mobilization request

01:14:52.175 --> 01:14:54.757
special search team fo hq!
Special search team to hq!

01:14:55.053 --> 01:14:58.966
We're at the haruki-ya snack bar
near the highway interchange in ward 8.

01:14:59.141 --> 01:15:04.886
It doesn't look like a bomb
explosion, so we think it was him.

01:15:05.188 --> 01:15:08.806
It was almost certainly the work of
the subject that escaped from the lab.

01:15:09.234 --> 01:15:11.725
Yes, sir! Yes, sir! Understood!

01:15:18.577 --> 01:15:19.737
Kaneda!

01:15:20.620 --> 01:15:23.202
What?! Yamagata's dead?!

01:15:23.290 --> 01:15:26.202
Something seemed strange
about him from the second I saw him.

01:15:26.293 --> 01:15:28.909
He was wearing what looked
like a white hospital gown.

01:15:29.171 --> 01:15:32.004
It was like he was a different person.

01:15:32.257 --> 01:15:36.626
Yamagata asked him
if he was really tetsuo.

01:15:37.262 --> 01:15:41.426
And then... yamagata, he...

01:15:44.603 --> 01:15:46.844
We've always been together.

01:15:47.189 --> 01:15:53.435
I've known everything about him
since we were in the children's home.

01:15:53.612 --> 01:15:57.355
He was a klutz, and
everybody made him cry.

01:15:58.575 --> 01:16:02.944
Oh, right... he wanted to
know where your bike was.

01:16:03.080 --> 01:16:04.616
My bike...?

01:16:13.256 --> 01:16:15.247
What're you gonna do?

01:16:15.884 --> 01:16:18.000
I'm gonna send yamagata his bike.

01:16:22.766 --> 01:16:25.883
You dumb bastard!

01:16:28.480 --> 01:16:29.720
Kaneda!

01:16:46.206 --> 01:16:47.206
Kei!

01:16:47.833 --> 01:16:48.833
Whats wrong?

01:16:53.130 --> 01:16:56.338
You! You were there that night...

01:16:59.678 --> 01:17:00.918
Wait!

01:17:07.018 --> 01:17:08.018
Kei!

01:17:12.149 --> 01:17:13.480
They disappeared!

01:17:15.152 --> 01:17:18.565
You were the ones who
changed tetsuo too, weren't you?

01:17:18.697 --> 01:17:23.612
Akira's power exists within everyone.

01:17:23.702 --> 01:17:24.782
Who's there?!

01:17:25.954 --> 01:17:32.200
But when that power is awakened,
even if you weren't prepared for it,

01:17:32.586 --> 01:17:37.296
you must choose how fo use it

01:17:38.508 --> 01:17:41.215
and be has made his choice.

01:17:42.846 --> 01:17:47.055
Telsto is our newest companion.

01:17:48.226 --> 01:17:52.219
We re partly to blame for his actions.

01:17:52.397 --> 01:17:55.230
Why did you take kei, then?!

01:17:55.692 --> 01:17:58.229
We want her fo help us.

01:17:58.403 --> 01:18:01.566
You can't just use people
like that! Bring kei back!

01:18:01.740 --> 01:18:06.234
Tetsuo's our friend! If anyone's
gonna kill him, it should be us!

01:18:08.538 --> 01:18:10.904
Hey!

01:18:11.041 --> 01:18:12.247
Damn it!

01:18:12.584 --> 01:18:16.748
Mr. omi and the other executives
have been arrested by the coup...?

01:18:16.880 --> 01:18:18.120
Y-yes, that's right.

01:18:18.256 --> 01:18:20.793
The house guards are
fighting them right now.

01:18:20.926 --> 01:18:22.006
Yes.

01:18:22.135 --> 01:18:24.751
I'd like to have a helicopter
waiting at west haneda.

01:18:24.846 --> 01:18:26.086
Yes.

01:18:26.806 --> 01:18:30.344
That damned colonel...
I can't believe he's taken up arms.

01:18:33.188 --> 01:18:34.849
1 underestimated him.

01:18:39.402 --> 01:18:41.518
Hold them here! Damn!

01:19:11.935 --> 01:19:13.300
Mr. nezu...

01:19:14.312 --> 01:19:17.019
R-ryu?! Is that you?

01:19:17.315 --> 01:19:19.055
I'm sorry, sir...

01:19:19.192 --> 01:19:21.649
The mission was a failure.

01:19:21.778 --> 01:19:23.393
What are you doing here?!

01:19:23.530 --> 01:19:25.816
I've told you, you can't be seen here!

01:19:27.200 --> 01:19:29.031
All of my men...

01:19:29.160 --> 01:19:31.116
They've all been killed.

01:19:31.204 --> 01:19:34.571
Y-you sold me out,
didn't you, you bastard?!

01:19:34.666 --> 01:19:36.156
What? You can't be...

01:19:39.754 --> 01:19:41.335
Kei...

01:19:46.928 --> 01:19:49.848
I got fresh fish in here, buddy!
I'm gonna get compensated for 'em, right?

01:19:49.931 --> 01:19:52.968
Please, I have to catch a flight at noon!

01:19:54.102 --> 01:19:55.512
What?

01:19:55.687 --> 01:19:57.598
7th Avenue is just ahead!

01:19:57.731 --> 01:19:59.687
It intersects this road
100 meters from here!

01:20:04.321 --> 01:20:05.857
Prepare for battle!

01:20:14.581 --> 01:20:18.119
Right, we've spotted the subject.

01:20:18.209 --> 01:20:20.666
What? Attack?!

01:20:20.754 --> 01:20:24.167
But he's just a... we're attacking a boy?!

01:20:28.553 --> 01:20:29.633
Look! There he is!

01:20:29.721 --> 01:20:30.551
Impossible!

01:20:30.638 --> 01:20:31.753
Is this for real?

01:20:40.106 --> 01:20:43.394
'Samurai spirit”

01:20:44.069 --> 01:20:45.809
firing preparations complete.

01:20:48.406 --> 01:20:50.397
Damn it! Fire!

01:21:03.713 --> 01:21:05.624
- Akira!
- It's lord Akira!

01:21:05.757 --> 01:21:08.169
It's the advent of lord Akira!

01:21:08.635 --> 01:21:10.250
That's not him! Don't be fooled!

01:21:10.428 --> 01:21:11.428
That's not lord Akira!

01:21:11.513 --> 01:21:12.844
Shut up!

01:21:13.807 --> 01:21:16.844
Long live lord Akira!

01:21:17.143 --> 01:21:18.758
Fire!

01:21:19.521 --> 01:21:20.521
Huh?

01:21:20.563 --> 01:21:21.848
Whats wrong?

01:22:49.319 --> 01:22:52.152
Ee eee

01:22:52.155 --> 01:22:52.268
“Akira”

01:22:52.280 --> 01:22:53.690
ese sea u a, rr ee

01:22:53.698 --> 01:22:55.301
in spite of martial law in the
name of freedom of the press!

01:22:55.325 --> 01:22:59.034
What in the world is
happening here in Neo Tokyo?

01:22:59.162 --> 01:23:02.029
What you see here seems lo
be fires caused by tank cannons.

01:23:02.165 --> 01:23:05.202
But who is this young boy?

01:23:05.335 --> 01:23:08.202
Is he fighting the coup
forces all by himself?

01:23:08.379 --> 01:23:14.796
Viewers, the army has just
illegally ordered us to land!

01:23:14.886 --> 01:23:17.127
Freedom of the press is now in jeopardy!

01:23:17.222 --> 01:23:19.679
What happened? Were they cut off?

01:23:19.766 --> 01:23:21.757
The bridge! He's heading for the bridge!

01:23:23.520 --> 01:23:24.726
Let's go see!

01:23:41.579 --> 01:23:43.490
Are you really going alone?

01:23:44.582 --> 01:23:47.289
He wants this, doesn't he?

01:23:47.418 --> 01:23:50.455
We should call the gang together.

01:23:50.588 --> 01:23:51.919
Hey!

01:23:52.006 --> 01:23:54.247
I wouldn't want to keep him waiting.

01:23:56.219 --> 01:23:58.301
Hey, kaneda! Wait!

01:24:05.353 --> 01:24:07.810
Half seem to be
anti-government demonstrators.

01:24:07.939 --> 01:24:12.399
The rest are... well, they're more
like some crazy cult than onlookers.

01:24:12.485 --> 01:24:15.443
They're following after the subject,
and more and more keep coming.

01:24:18.658 --> 01:24:18.817
'We worship the great lord Akira”

01:24:18.825 --> 01:24:23.114
'we worship the great lord Akira”
_and more and more keep coming.

01:24:23.121 --> 01:24:23.200
'We worship the great lord Akira”

01:24:23.204 --> 01:24:25.695
'we worship the great lord Akira”
_and more and more keep coming.

01:24:25.707 --> 01:24:25.786
'We worship the great lord Akira”

01:24:25.790 --> 01:24:29.032
'we worship the great lord Akira”
_and more and more keep coming.

01:24:29.043 --> 01:24:31.284
Consume our unclean hearts!

01:24:31.379 --> 01:24:33.711
Fear not!

01:24:33.840 --> 01:24:38.960
Your bodies will be purified in the flames!

01:24:40.179 --> 01:24:41.464
Ready!

01:24:43.558 --> 01:24:44.638
Fire!

01:24:50.481 --> 01:24:54.224
Set the switch to hold for three
seconds and converge your beams!

01:24:54.444 --> 01:24:55.444
Aim!

01:24:55.528 --> 01:24:56.893
Fire!

01:25:02.619 --> 01:25:04.484
Watch this!

01:25:10.460 --> 01:25:12.496
Look out! Let's get out of here!

01:25:23.056 --> 01:25:24.921
Help me!

01:25:31.648 --> 01:25:34.185
Ground forces! Ground forces, come in!

01:25:34.359 --> 01:25:36.475
Report! What is the subject's status?!

01:25:36.569 --> 01:25:37.684
Ground forces!

01:25:39.989 --> 01:25:41.445
Call the doctor.

01:25:41.699 --> 01:25:44.736
We have confirmation of his
recent movements and are in pursuit.

01:25:44.869 --> 01:25:47.235
His present position is... let's see...

01:25:47.372 --> 01:25:52.457
Coordinates 99871 by 4332.

01:25:52.543 --> 01:25:56.286
That's about 2 km south of the
Olympics construction site in the old city.

01:25:56.381 --> 01:25:57.461
What?!

01:26:02.970 --> 01:26:04.961
What was that?

01:26:05.098 --> 01:26:06.759
Look!

01:26:07.058 --> 01:26:10.676
That's near the toll booth that's
being guarded by the 2nd platoon.

01:26:10.812 --> 01:26:12.268
Wha...?

01:26:13.147 --> 01:26:14.147
Huh?

01:26:17.110 --> 01:26:20.898
Please turn around!
This area's off limits to civilians!

01:26:21.030 --> 01:26:23.646
What? That's the subject?!

01:26:23.741 --> 01:26:25.231
S-stop!

01:26:25.368 --> 01:26:26.483
Stop, damn it!

01:27:32.477 --> 01:27:34.809
Nice place you have here.

01:27:42.320 --> 01:27:45.107
Wait, you were with kaneda.

01:27:45.239 --> 01:27:49.198
You shouldn't use your power this way.

01:27:49.952 --> 01:27:50.952
What?

01:27:51.037 --> 01:27:55.656
In the end, you won't be able fo control it

01:27:55.833 --> 01:27:57.164
the kids...

01:27:57.376 --> 01:27:59.037
You're those brats, aren't you?!

01:28:17.021 --> 01:28:18.852
Okay, then...!

01:28:40.920 --> 01:28:41.920
What the...?

01:28:53.558 --> 01:28:54.889
It's not safe here, colonel!

01:29:35.975 --> 01:29:38.136
Well, what're you gonna do?

01:31:05.356 --> 01:31:06.937
Open up!

01:31:17.660 --> 01:31:19.696
What the hell?

01:31:19.829 --> 01:31:22.491
That's Akira, tefsuo!

01:31:22.832 --> 01:31:26.040
That's the Akira” you wanted to meet

01:31:26.168 --> 01:31:28.534
there's your Messiah!

01:31:28.879 --> 01:31:31.461
After his transcendental awakening,

01:31:31.549 --> 01:31:36.293
his body was subjected to
every test known to science.

01:31:36.387 --> 01:31:40.300
And that's what was left of it.

01:31:47.898 --> 01:31:49.388
“Cranial nerve”

01:31:49.525 --> 01:31:53.564
the scientists back then
were unable to solve the mystery,

01:31:53.696 --> 01:31:57.860
so they decided to entrust their
collected data and test samples

01:31:57.992 --> 01:32:02.656
to future generations by
preserving them in a frozen capsule.

01:32:03.497 --> 01:32:05.078
Sol... we'll use sol!

01:32:05.207 --> 01:32:06.207
Sir?

01:32:08.252 --> 01:32:11.244
Akira is already dead!

01:32:11.422 --> 01:32:14.630
Well? Are you satisfied now, tetsuo?

01:32:19.430 --> 01:32:21.921
So come back with us'

01:32:22.016 --> 01:32:23.176
like hell!

01:32:24.393 --> 01:32:26.429
Contact the central defense center

01:32:26.562 --> 01:32:30.020
and tell them to patch us
through to sol's control circuits!

01:32:30.107 --> 01:32:31.107
Yes, sir!

01:32:47.166 --> 01:32:49.122
Hey, watch it!

01:32:49.251 --> 01:32:53.119
Damn it, move! Get out of the way!

01:33:09.647 --> 01:33:12.229
What is this, science class?

01:33:29.250 --> 01:33:32.242
What's wrong? Have some trouble?

01:33:32.545 --> 01:33:36.163
Yeah, but I already took care of it.

01:33:36.298 --> 01:33:38.485
If you were here earlier,
you could've watched the show.

01:33:38.509 --> 01:33:41.171
You had me worried again.

01:33:41.303 --> 01:33:44.466
I figured you'd be standing here,
sobbing like a little baby.

01:33:44.557 --> 01:33:49.267
Kaneda, you've always
been a pain in the ass.

01:33:49.353 --> 01:33:54.017
You've been telling me what
to do ever since we were kids.

01:33:54.191 --> 01:33:56.056
You always treat me like a kid.

01:33:56.318 --> 01:33:59.025
You always show up and
start bossing me around!

01:33:59.238 --> 01:34:01.229
And now you're a boss, too...

01:34:01.365 --> 01:34:03.071
Of this pile of rubble.

01:34:03.367 --> 01:34:04.607
Kaneda!

01:34:04.702 --> 01:34:07.193
That's mister kaneda to you, punk!

01:34:07.329 --> 01:34:09.615
Die!

01:34:19.049 --> 01:34:20.084
Tetsuo!

01:34:44.408 --> 01:34:45.523
Son of a...

01:34:59.465 --> 01:35:00.580
Kei!

01:35:02.468 --> 01:35:03.674
Oh, hell!

01:35:07.556 --> 01:35:10.013
Let's do it!

01:35:20.778 --> 01:35:22.268
Got him!

01:35:23.530 --> 01:35:24.530
Huh?

01:35:29.620 --> 01:35:31.110
The battery?!

01:35:31.247 --> 01:35:32.953
What's the matter, kaneda?

01:35:34.541 --> 01:35:36.953
God damn it! This ain't fair, tetsuo!

01:35:37.127 --> 01:35:38.708
Fight with your bare hands!

01:35:42.007 --> 01:35:43.543
Oh, this is funny...

01:35:45.177 --> 01:35:47.634
Feeling frustrated, kaneda?

01:35:47.763 --> 01:35:50.721
Now do you understand how it feels?

01:35:57.147 --> 01:35:58.978
What's this light?

01:36:09.994 --> 01:36:11.074
Well, did you hit him?

01:36:11.203 --> 01:36:14.182
We're too close to the impact point.
There's too much electrical interference.

01:36:14.206 --> 01:36:15.662
Prepare a second volley!

01:36:38.689 --> 01:36:42.932
Hey! Kaneda!

01:37:01.420 --> 01:37:04.457
Tetsuo!

01:37:19.730 --> 01:37:20.970
Shit...

01:37:21.523 --> 01:37:22.888
Huh?

01:37:23.025 --> 01:37:24.025
What the...?

01:37:59.937 --> 01:38:01.598
Correcting for tracking system error.

01:38:01.772 --> 01:38:03.603
T-minus-20 to energy alteration.

01:38:03.774 --> 01:38:05.214
- Fire extinguishers!
- Are you okay?

01:38:05.275 --> 01:38:06.105
Hurry! Hurry!

01:38:06.235 --> 01:38:08.601
What happened? What's going on?

01:38:17.454 --> 01:38:19.365
Kaneda!

01:38:20.916 --> 01:38:22.122
Kai! Kei!

01:38:22.292 --> 01:38:23.702
- Kaneda!
- Kaneda!

01:38:23.836 --> 01:38:24.621
Get on!

01:38:24.753 --> 01:38:25.868
Get on? Where?

01:38:26.004 --> 01:38:27.414
Hurry! Hurry!

01:38:49.820 --> 01:38:51.151
What's that?

01:39:05.377 --> 01:39:07.493
They say it's sol.

01:39:18.348 --> 01:39:19.713
Magnificent...

01:39:29.693 --> 01:39:33.857
When telsuo's power reaches its peak?

01:39:33.989 --> 01:39:35.729
That's when we do it

01:39:35.866 --> 01:39:38.448
but will if work?

01:39:39.328 --> 01:39:44.288
The future doesn't
proceed along a single course.

01:39:44.458 --> 01:39:47.666
There ought to be a future we can choose.

01:39:57.888 --> 01:39:59.549
What's tetsuo's status?

01:39:59.681 --> 01:40:01.546
Ah, colonel...

01:40:01.725 --> 01:40:05.058
We set up a camera in the
stadium a while ago.

01:40:05.187 --> 01:40:06.893
We have him under observation.

01:40:08.398 --> 01:40:12.391
Colonel, you must take a look at this data!

01:40:12.569 --> 01:40:15.652
We're still analyzing the energy
given off by the subject, but...

01:40:15.781 --> 01:40:18.648
It's magnificent. Absolutely magnificent.

01:40:18.784 --> 01:40:21.571
This is clearly a proton collapse.

01:40:21.662 --> 01:40:25.701
We're also detecting a fair number of
what we believe to be unknown particles.

01:40:25.832 --> 01:40:28.744
If we can put this into a
theoretical framework, physics...

01:40:28.919 --> 01:40:30.250
No, science...

01:40:30.337 --> 01:40:33.329
Humanity itself could touch the
fundamental truths of the universe!

01:40:35.759 --> 01:40:37.499
Oh. That's...

01:40:37.636 --> 01:40:40.378
We still haven't finished
making our adjustments.

01:40:40.556 --> 01:40:42.421
Uh, colonel!

01:40:47.354 --> 01:40:49.265
T-that's...!

01:40:52.359 --> 01:40:54.771
You bastard! What did I tell you?!

01:40:54.861 --> 01:40:56.601
B-but, colonel!

01:40:56.697 --> 01:40:59.939
I couldn't throw away
such a magnificent subject!

01:41:00.617 --> 01:41:01.617
Shut up!

01:41:25.434 --> 01:41:27.140
Shit! It's on fire!

01:41:27.227 --> 01:41:28.387
The battery! The battery!

01:41:28.478 --> 01:41:31.470
My bike! It's burning up!

01:41:31.607 --> 01:41:34.064
Hey, what's a bike or two?

01:41:34.192 --> 01:41:38.231
What? Then there's nothing
wrong with using yours, right?

01:41:38.363 --> 01:41:39.478
You heard that?

01:41:39.573 --> 01:41:40.733
Yeah, I did!

01:41:40.824 --> 01:41:42.655
Hey, your bike's still on fire.

01:42:24.284 --> 01:42:26.024
Tetsuo?

01:42:37.464 --> 01:42:41.878
Tetsuo, why does
everyone call you "Akira"?

01:42:41.968 --> 01:42:46.257
He never existed in the first place.

01:42:46.431 --> 01:42:48.296
They didn't care who it was.

01:42:51.103 --> 01:42:54.061
Just so long as he destroyed things.

01:42:54.231 --> 01:42:55.516
Your arm!

01:42:56.733 --> 01:43:00.225
It doesn't look like much,
but it works pretty good.

01:43:03.448 --> 01:43:05.564
What's wrong? Are you okay?

01:43:08.286 --> 01:43:09.901
It's nothing!

01:43:10.080 --> 01:43:10.819
Tetsuo...

01:43:10.956 --> 01:43:12.662
Shut up! Just go away!

01:43:20.507 --> 01:43:22.463
Medicine...

01:43:22.884 --> 01:43:25.921
What's wrong, tetsuo? Are you in pain?

01:43:26.263 --> 01:43:29.926
Go back to the lab and
get me some of that medicine!

01:43:30.016 --> 01:43:31.631
Did you hear that, doctor?

01:43:31.852 --> 01:43:33.092
Yes, colonel.

01:43:33.270 --> 01:43:35.511
Well? Can you see any signs of it?

01:43:35.647 --> 01:43:38.104
I'm not entirely certain,

01:43:38.233 --> 01:43:42.522
but it seems that the power that had been
held back by the drugs is breaking free.

01:43:42.612 --> 01:43:46.104
He may not be able to control the
power that has awakened so suddenly.

01:43:46.283 --> 01:43:48.615
At any rate, he's in an
extremely dangerous condition!

01:43:49.703 --> 01:43:54.197
If you don't go back to the lab and
receive proper treatment, you may die.

01:43:57.169 --> 01:44:00.957
You want me to enroll in that
kindergarten and live happily ever after?

01:44:01.047 --> 01:44:06.633
Take my medicine every day
and shrivel up like those kids?!

01:44:11.892 --> 01:44:15.350
Kaori... kaori...

01:44:15.979 --> 01:44:19.847
Please... I need that medicine...

01:44:20.108 --> 01:44:21.314
No...!

01:44:21.985 --> 01:44:22.985
Tetsuo!

01:44:24.654 --> 01:44:25.939
Tetsuo!

01:44:27.991 --> 01:44:29.151
Tetsuo...

01:45:01.316 --> 01:45:02.522
Kaneda?!

01:45:40.856 --> 01:45:42.062
Huh?

01:45:49.489 --> 01:45:51.571
Son of a...

01:45:55.120 --> 01:45:57.406
You kids... what are you doing here?

01:46:03.420 --> 01:46:05.081
You never learn, do you?

01:46:07.507 --> 01:46:09.418
Tetsuo!

01:46:23.523 --> 01:46:25.263
Takashi...

01:46:27.652 --> 01:46:28.937
Akira...

01:46:29.112 --> 01:46:31.694
'Optic nerve”

01:46:42.584 --> 01:46:45.997
Kaneda...? H-help me...!

01:46:55.680 --> 01:46:57.136
Kaori...

01:47:00.644 --> 01:47:03.056
Help me...!

01:47:14.866 --> 01:47:16.822
Help me!

01:47:16.993 --> 01:47:18.654
Stop it!

01:47:35.804 --> 01:47:36.668
Kaori?

01:47:36.763 --> 01:47:39.675
Kaori! Kaori!

01:47:39.849 --> 01:47:42.511
Tetsuo? Is that you, tetsuo?!

01:47:42.644 --> 01:47:45.681
Kaori! Kaori's gonna die!

01:47:45.814 --> 01:47:48.521
What?! What did you say?!

01:47:48.608 --> 01:47:51.190
My body's not doing what I tell it to!

01:47:51.277 --> 01:47:53.643
My powers acting on its own...!

01:47:53.738 --> 01:47:54.738
Kaori!

01:47:56.366 --> 01:47:58.357
Kaori's dying!

01:47:58.535 --> 01:48:00.696
Kaneda, help me!

01:48:00.870 --> 01:48:02.781
Stop, tetsuo!

01:48:02.914 --> 01:48:04.950
Stop it!

01:48:05.083 --> 01:48:08.792
Kaori's pain is coming info me...!

01:48:10.547 --> 01:48:13.038
Tetsuo!

01:48:13.133 --> 01:48:17.376
Kaneda! Run away!

01:48:29.983 --> 01:48:32.395
Tetsuo!

01:48:43.955 --> 01:48:47.664
Kiyoko! Takashi! Masaru!
Get away from here!

01:48:52.088 --> 01:48:53.168
Come on!

01:48:59.763 --> 01:49:02.596
I can't believe it. It's as if...

01:49:15.278 --> 01:49:18.145
Kiyoko! Taka...

01:49:52.524 --> 01:49:56.312
Hi, Akira.

01:50:05.161 --> 01:50:06.822
Th-this is...

01:50:08.331 --> 01:50:10.322
But that's... 0h, no!

01:50:20.009 --> 01:50:22.170
W-where am 1?

01:50:22.679 --> 01:50:24.920
Hurry! Get info the tunnel!

01:50:25.014 --> 01:50:26.345
You'll be safe in there.

01:50:26.432 --> 01:50:28.343
Kiyoko! Where are you?

01:50:43.032 --> 01:50:44.772
Tetsuo!

01:50:45.034 --> 01:50:47.275
Kaneda!

01:50:47.704 --> 01:50:48.944
Hang on!

01:50:51.124 --> 01:50:53.615
- If you don't get out of here now, you'll...
- Out of the way!

01:50:53.751 --> 01:50:55.207
Tetsuo!

01:50:55.295 --> 01:50:56.876
Don't go!

01:51:03.720 --> 01:51:05.676
No, takashi!

01:51:06.347 --> 01:51:09.635
If you went in now, you'd be trapped, too.

01:51:09.893 --> 01:51:13.636
But none of this is his fault!

01:51:20.737 --> 01:51:23.649
- Takashi!
- Takashi!

01:51:30.079 --> 01:51:36.416
If we went in, we wouldn't be
strong enough to come back out.

01:51:37.253 --> 01:51:41.417
But if the three of us worked together,
maybe we could at least save that boy.

01:51:41.591 --> 01:51:43.172
You're right.

01:51:43.259 --> 01:51:45.090
Together, the three of us could...

01:51:54.020 --> 01:51:56.011
Oh, man...!

01:51:56.105 --> 01:51:58.938
We should get out of here. Hey!

01:51:59.609 --> 01:52:01.145
Kaneda...

01:52:34.018 --> 01:52:37.476
Look, youre not revving your engine enough.

01:52:37.605 --> 01:52:41.223
When you go into a corner, lean like
you're trying to kill yourself. Watch!

01:52:41.359 --> 01:52:42.895
What re you doing?

01:52:43.027 --> 01:52:44.983
Cornering, man.

01:52:46.531 --> 01:52:48.396
Got it, telsuo...?

01:52:54.664 --> 01:52:56.404
Look, there's another one!

01:52:56.499 --> 01:52:58.660
- Another transfer student?
- He was abandoned.

01:52:58.793 --> 01:53:00.749
You can see it in his face.

01:53:04.465 --> 01:53:09.755
Are... are these your dreams, tetsuo?

01:53:11.097 --> 01:53:12.177
Wait!

01:54:29.675 --> 01:54:32.758
This is Akira...?

01:54:32.887 --> 01:54:36.095
Yes we called him.

01:54:36.265 --> 01:54:38.426
To have him lake telsuo away.

